<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/hot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: WoW vs EQ2 &nbsp;(Read 1064 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=773" title="View the profile of Cocomo">Cocomo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/terminator.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Retired Paladin<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=773"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10024#msg10024"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10024#msg10024">WoW vs EQ2</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> August 12, 2004, 02:01:37 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hi there everyone!<br /><br />Cocomo here.&nbsp; My character has been retired but I am still very much on RN in spirit.<br /><br />Wondering if anyone thinking of playing World of Warcraft or Everquest 2.&nbsp; I noticed some of you are playing WoW beta so I would like to know your thoughts on it.&nbsp; Also, just for the speculative view point of what we heard from Sony/Blizzard and fan sites, which one do you think is worth playing?<br /><br />Share your thoughts, and miss you all!<br /><br />Cocomo<br />Once a Knight on Rodcet Nife<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10037"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=272" title="View the profile of Rednight">Rednight</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 141<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/genjuro.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Huuh...Whaat...YEAAAH~!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/mi_2_az@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="mi_2_az@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=272"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10037#msg10037"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10037#msg10037">Re: WoW vs EQ2</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> August 12, 2004, 04:36:03 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							WoW will draw a large amount of peeps from EQ, it already has been.&nbsp; The PvP will be fun there are some beat PvP raid vids on die-guild.org you can check out.&nbsp; Not sure when EQ 2 will actually release but I am looking for something that is less of a time sink.&nbsp; I read somewhere that it is easier to level, rather then EQ is.&nbsp; Although who knows its still in Beta.&nbsp; I think everyone played the WC series, so when it goes live online......mass exodus.&nbsp; Tho I do like the SS from EQ2.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10095"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=657" title="View the profile of Novellus">Novellus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 10<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://imagehost.vibrahost.com/uploads/Crit.bmp" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=657"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:arizonapop@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10095#msg10095"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10095#msg10095">Re: WoW vs EQ2</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> August 15, 2004, 01:09:03 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp; &nbsp;Hey there man Cocomo...Nice to see u ard...Much as i had left RN...im residing in Nameless...and alot of RN &quot;exiles&quot; over here too...<br /><br /><br />EQ2 seems pretty neat....but i would go just wherever my friends will go
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
