							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10261#msg10261"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10261#msg10261">Re: WoW vs EQ2</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> August 19, 2004, 05:34:39 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<a href="http://forums.gucomics.com/viewtopic.php?t=3683" target="_blank">http://forums.gucomics.com/viewtopic.php?t=3683</a><br /><br />Seems Blizzard is already mismanaging the technical side of the game... Granted this is a single thing, but some other interesting beta bugs.<br /><br />I doubt that WoW will be better quality programming than EQ, or EQ2.<br /><br />Same crap, different name
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Guild Leader of <a href="http://www.fotguild.com" target="_blank">Fires of Time</a><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 2;">A little piece of paper with a picture drawn<br />&nbsp;floats on down the street till the wind is gone. <br />The memory now is like the picture was then, <br />When the paper&#039;s crumpled up, it can&#039;t be perfect again. </span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10321"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=544" title="View the profile of Kithkahn">Kithkahn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 17<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/joker.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								&quot;What did you expect?...I&#039;m a thief...&quot;<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=544"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10321#msg10321"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10321#msg10321">Re: WoW vs EQ2</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> August 21, 2004, 05:46:28 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I agree, personally I have found these type games to just be too consuming.&nbsp; I have played EQ for almost 3 years and just don&#039;t have the heart for it anymore.&nbsp; I know a lot of folks have left and came back after a long hiatus and who knows maybe I will to.&nbsp; I wish everyone luck in EQ2 or WoW they both look pretty cool.&nbsp; I just can&#039;t personally justify starting another similar game and get sucked in again.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Kithkahn Entreri (Master of Trickery and Hijinx)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
