								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;ll definitely be in EQ2, already have all my character&#039;s avatars set up via that spiffy character creation CD &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />I just hope SoE meets it&#039;s promised 2004 launch date *fingers crossed*<br /><br />Until then there are tons of awesome PC games coming out this fall to keep me busy.<br /><br />Hope to see some of ya in EQ2 too ;)<br /><br />cheers&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
