								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1012.msg10418#msg10418">Re: WoW vs EQ2</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> August 24, 2004, 12:01:06 pm &#187;</span></td>
